  "title": "SAP Connector for Analytics: A Smarter Way to Connect and Automate",
  "summary": "If your organization runs SAP, your most critical business data lives there. Finance records, procurement data, supply chain transactions, HR information - SAP is the system of record that the rest of the business depends on. But having data in SAP and being able to use it in your reports and workflows are two different things. An SAP connector bridges that gap. It gives your analytics platform, your reporting tools, or your automation workflows direct access to SAP data, without manual exports,",
